        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminium, secondary, from old scrap, at plant
Data are based on the EAA report 2008 which refers to 2005. Alloy input is modelled as aluminium scrap based on EAA report 2013 (section 7.7.2).;
UUID: 4ad4b4d8-5f7b-332d-b9d5-d74acbcece15
Melting, alloying and cast-ing of old scrap to secon-dary aluminium billets.
Location: Global
Technology: Industry data
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data are based on the EAA report 2008 which refers to 2005. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4ad4b4d8-5f7b-332d-b9d5-d74acbcece15.xml</text>
